WEBVTT

01:29.390 --> 01:34.420
[Never-Ending Summer]

01:35.640 --> 01:37.840
[Episode 2]

01:39.070 --> 01:40.120
I'm out.

01:40.120 --> 01:41.200
Where are you?

01:42.750 --> 01:43.750
I saw you.

01:43.780 --> 01:45.670
Mom! Mom!

01:46.310 --> 01:47.070
Mom!

01:48.190 --> 01:50.509
-Mom, are you going to Guangzhou again?
-Wan, go do your homework.

01:50.509 --> 01:51.560
I thought you would stay

01:51.560 --> 01:52.960
a few more days this time.

01:53.280 --> 01:54.039
Mom, I want to go

01:54.039 --> 01:55.300
to Guangzhou with you.

01:56.770 --> 01:57.759
Wan.

01:58.320 --> 02:00.070
If you leave, what about Grandma?

02:00.070 --> 02:01.370
She'll be lonely all by herself,

02:01.370 --> 02:01.940
right?

02:02.830 --> 02:03.880
When I come back,

02:03.910 --> 02:05.260
I'll bring you pretty dresses

02:05.260 --> 02:06.620
and yummy treats, okay?

02:06.650 --> 02:07.520
Go back now.

02:07.820 --> 02:09.490
But every time you lie to me,

02:09.509 --> 02:11.009
you smile just like that.

02:24.090 --> 02:24.920
Wan.

02:26.480 --> 02:27.610
You're still young.

02:28.630 --> 02:30.630
There's a lot you don't understand.

02:33.720 --> 02:35.120
If I take you with me,

02:37.540 --> 02:39.470
neither of us will have a good life.

02:46.320 --> 02:47.720
Wait for me at home, okay?

02:47.780 --> 02:48.710
I will come back.

02:50.190 --> 02:51.650
Grandma will come get you.

02:52.450 --> 02:53.040
Go back.

02:53.420 --> 02:53.980
Go back.

02:54.910 --> 02:56.070
Mom!

02:56.070 --> 02:57.190
-Go back!
-Mom!

02:58.380 --> 03:02.740
Mom! Mom!

03:03.470 --> 03:04.510
Mom!

03:04.510 --> 03:06.100
Am I not a good girl?

03:06.100 --> 03:07.660
Is that why Dad doesn't want me

03:07.660 --> 03:09.260
and neither do you?

03:09.380 --> 03:13.030
Mom, don't leave me!

03:13.510 --> 03:14.820
Mom!

03:15.660 --> 03:19.230
Mom, don't leave me!

03:23.790 --> 03:26.030
Mom!

03:27.710 --> 03:30.360
Mom!

03:48.810 --> 03:50.410
Tell me if you need anything.

03:50.430 --> 03:51.550
I can help you.

04:51.400 --> 04:57.560
[Guo Xiangling] [Lu Xixiao]

05:02.020 --> 05:02.630
Dad.

05:02.140 --> 05:06.250
[Guo Xiangling] [Lu Xixiao]

05:03.820 --> 05:05.620
I'm going to do something wrong.

05:06.550 --> 05:07.700
Will you forgive me?

05:12.810 --> 05:14.140
Grilled fish!

05:14.140 --> 05:15.460
Freshly made, right here!

05:15.460 --> 05:17.520
Come and have a taste if you want some!

05:18.220 --> 05:19.550
Yu.

05:21.220 --> 05:22.460
Look at your little fish.

05:22.460 --> 05:23.560
It's about to die.

05:24.630 --> 05:25.510
You keep your fish tank

05:25.510 --> 05:27.630
facing a grilled fish stall every day.

05:27.630 --> 05:29.460
No wonder your business isn't doing well.

05:29.460 --> 05:31.050
That's why I'm transferring it.

05:31.050 --> 05:31.930
See?

05:31.240 --> 05:33.060
[Store Transfer]

05:32.380 --> 05:34.260
The smoke from his stall is messing up

05:34.260 --> 05:35.120
my whole setup.

05:35.550 --> 05:36.260
If you're leaving, just leave.

05:36.260 --> 05:37.460
What's that got to do with me?

05:37.460 --> 05:38.260
Stop blocking my space.

05:38.260 --> 05:39.870
You're delaying my business every day.

05:39.870 --> 05:40.870
I don't even want to mention it.

05:40.870 --> 05:42.190
Your smoke is really...

05:42.190 --> 05:42.990
So what?

05:43.820 --> 05:44.310
Yu.

05:44.630 --> 05:45.310
Well, since

05:46.580 --> 05:48.260
you're leaving, what about the fish?

05:48.260 --> 05:49.070
What about them?

05:49.070 --> 05:50.870
They'll live or die on their own.

06:05.990 --> 06:07.140
Ping. Ping.

06:07.140 --> 06:07.750
Yeah.

06:07.820 --> 06:08.870
Do me a favor later.

06:08.870 --> 06:09.470
What is it?

06:09.780 --> 06:10.780
Well, lend me that

06:10.900 --> 06:11.900
Doggie's place or whatever,

06:11.900 --> 06:12.830
just for a while.

06:13.940 --> 06:14.770
What for?

06:15.630 --> 06:17.140
Why do you need Doggie's place?

06:17.140 --> 06:18.510
Don't worry. It won't die.

06:18.510 --> 06:19.190
No way.

06:19.810 --> 06:21.670
Where's Doggie supposed to stay?

06:22.020 --> 06:24.680
Doggie, he's trying to take
your house from you.

06:29.590 --> 06:31.030
Doggie, remember him.

06:31.070 --> 06:32.510
He occupied your house.

06:32.510 --> 06:33.870
What do you mean by occupy?

06:33.870 --> 06:36.070
I told you, I'm borrowing it.

06:37.200 --> 06:39.130
I didn't expect you to be so caring.

06:39.510 --> 06:40.540
Are you kidding?

06:41.650 --> 06:42.330
Lu Xixiao.

06:44.270 --> 06:46.270
Where's my Doggie supposed to live?

06:46.310 --> 06:47.070
Doggie...

06:51.930 --> 06:54.830
Buy fish, get a free tank and some plants.

06:55.040 --> 06:55.640
Where?

06:55.860 --> 06:56.720
Go to Yu's place.

06:56.720 --> 06:57.450
Go ask him.

06:57.610 --> 06:59.010
-Yu's place?
-Hurry.

07:09.440 --> 07:12.740
[Today I am proud of Yangming,
tomorrow Yangming will be proud of me]

07:11.400 --> 07:12.460
I am wearing my uniform.

07:12.460 --> 07:13.110
Why write my name down?

07:13.110 --> 07:14.820
Your buttons aren't done up.

07:15.310 --> 07:15.900
It's so hot.

07:15.900 --> 07:18.080
-Buttoning up is hot.
-Everyone's hot.

07:18.080 --> 07:19.010
School ID badge.

07:19.290 --> 07:20.090
Write faster.

07:20.120 --> 07:21.200
I'm in a rush.

07:21.400 --> 07:23.080
Lu Xixiao, Jiang Fan.

07:23.110 --> 07:25.170
I know both your student IDs by heart.

07:25.310 --> 07:26.110
Just let it go.

07:29.030 --> 07:30.190
It's just too hot.

07:37.110 --> 07:38.640
We're all classmates here.

07:41.480 --> 07:42.700
Swimming pool tonight.

07:42.700 --> 07:44.560
You haven't forgotten, have you?

07:58.980 --> 08:00.860
What are you looking at?
Give me back my badge.

08:00.860 --> 08:02.320
Consider yourself lucky.

08:09.570 --> 08:10.690
You guys...

08:10.720 --> 08:11.520
It's a secret.

08:13.230 --> 08:14.160
So many secrets.

08:15.350 --> 08:16.580
What are you two whispering about?

08:16.580 --> 08:17.430
And you were sneaking a smile.

08:17.430 --> 08:18.690
None of your business.

08:45.940 --> 08:47.000
What are you doing?

08:48.340 --> 08:50.740
Looking at the future.

08:52.070 --> 08:53.330
Looking at the future?

08:53.620 --> 08:54.150
How?

08:55.910 --> 08:57.260
Close your eyes.

08:58.820 --> 09:00.080
Then you'll see it too.

09:12.210 --> 09:13.410
I can't see anything.

09:22.580 --> 09:24.310
So you're just messing with me.

09:26.430 --> 09:27.190
What's the big deal

09:27.190 --> 09:28.720
you wanted to talk about?

09:30.250 --> 09:31.650
I wasn't trying

09:31.670 --> 09:32.950
to snoop that day.

09:33.500 --> 09:34.500
But I saw

09:35.130 --> 09:38.130
that the book you're reading
isn't high school level.

09:38.430 --> 09:39.370
Honestly, I think

09:39.370 --> 09:40.220
you need a study partner

09:40.220 --> 09:41.680
more than self-teaching.

09:42.100 --> 09:43.230
I'm the perfect fit.

09:43.550 --> 09:44.950
So you just ran over here

09:45.790 --> 09:46.670
to notify me?

09:48.620 --> 09:49.460
You obviously don't want others to know

09:49.460 --> 09:51.190
about you going abroad, right?

09:52.460 --> 09:53.150
You could also go to

09:53.150 --> 09:54.210
a tutoring center.

09:54.600 --> 09:56.460
But you're studying by yourself.

09:57.960 --> 09:59.700
I just want to earn some extra money.

09:59.700 --> 10:01.030
Plus, I've got the time

10:01.030 --> 10:02.690
and this place is convenient.

10:03.030 --> 10:04.090
Most importantly,

10:05.960 --> 10:07.450
I won't tell anyone.

10:14.910 --> 10:15.770
What do you say?

10:20.270 --> 10:21.150
I thought you were going to say

10:21.150 --> 10:22.550
you're a great teacher.

10:24.390 --> 10:25.670
I am a great teacher.

10:33.310 --> 10:34.840
Pleasure working with you.

10:50.190 --> 10:51.250
Take it or leave it.

10:52.250 --> 10:52.790
Tomorrow, I'll make sure

10:52.790 --> 10:54.050
the whole school knows

10:54.290 --> 10:55.540
you're going abroad.

10:55.630 --> 10:56.490
Don't you dare.

11:18.890 --> 11:21.090
I'll give you two days to think about it.

11:36.260 --> 11:44.760
[Yangming High School]

12:09.300 --> 12:09.950
[Student Name: Feng Yue]
[Student Class: Class 7, Grade 12]

12:10.060 --> 12:11.230
[Student Name: Zhang Bingbing]
[Student Class: Class 7, Grade 12]

12:11.290 --> 12:15.030
[Student Name: Lu Xixiao]
[Student Class: Class 7, Grade 12]

12:32.250 --> 12:37.050
[Attendance Intention Survey:
Unable to Attend]

12:42.700 --> 12:43.230
Hello?

12:43.860 --> 12:44.390
Hello?

12:46.150 --> 12:46.740
Hello.

12:47.540 --> 12:49.880
Is this Ms. Guo Xiangling?

12:51.190 --> 12:51.670
Yes.

12:51.670 --> 12:52.820
Who is this?

12:53.690 --> 12:55.490
I'm Lu Xixiao's English teacher

12:55.740 --> 12:57.270
and vice homeroom teacher.

12:57.540 --> 12:59.090
I noticed
on the parent-teacher meeting form

12:59.090 --> 13:02.520
[Unable to Attend]

12:59.910 --> 13:00.740
that neither you nor his father

13:00.740 --> 13:02.600
will be attending. Is that right?

13:04.760 --> 13:07.160
How come I've never
heard him mention this?

13:07.580 --> 13:09.070
How did you get my number?

13:11.460 --> 13:12.460
Here's the thing.

13:13.680 --> 13:14.790
Although he didn't fill in

13:14.790 --> 13:15.550
your number,

13:16.090 --> 13:17.730
it's registered in the student

13:17.730 --> 13:19.130
emergency contact book.

13:23.230 --> 13:25.430
Other parents also mention you often.

13:26.550 --> 13:28.440
They said that you handled everything

13:28.440 --> 13:29.830
inside and out at home,

13:30.460 --> 13:32.390
and contacting you would be right.

13:33.740 --> 13:35.800
Then you've come to the right person.

13:35.820 --> 13:36.340
Yes,

13:36.340 --> 13:37.310
I take care of

13:37.310 --> 13:38.840
all the household matters.

13:38.860 --> 13:39.920
What's the matter?

13:41.670 --> 13:42.390
Well,

13:43.220 --> 13:44.860
the college entrance exam
is coming up soon.

13:44.860 --> 13:46.030
We still need you to attend

13:46.030 --> 13:47.690
the parent-teacher meeting,

13:48.150 --> 13:50.500
so we can discuss

13:50.860 --> 13:51.700
his studies

13:51.700 --> 13:53.230
and his application plans.

13:54.390 --> 13:54.980
Okay.

13:57.580 --> 13:59.390
Well, does

13:59.620 --> 14:00.950
Xixiao know about this?

14:01.340 --> 14:02.580
Kids his age

14:02.580 --> 14:04.100
tend to clash with their families.

14:04.100 --> 14:06.120
[Student Name: Lu Xixiao]
[Student Class: Class 7, Grade 12]

14:06.820 --> 14:08.030
I'll get him to agree.

14:09.050 --> 14:09.600
What?

14:12.560 --> 14:13.940
I mean...

14:15.070 --> 14:16.600
He's still the same lately,

14:17.150 --> 14:18.210
causing troubles.

14:18.910 --> 14:20.000
I've talked to him.

14:22.220 --> 14:24.480
Okay. So when is it?

14:26.830 --> 14:28.090
The 25th of this month.

14:28.950 --> 14:30.250
Okay, got it.

14:30.910 --> 14:31.440
Alright.

14:32.590 --> 14:33.690
I'll see you then.

14:34.950 --> 14:36.210
Alright, see you then.

14:41.570 --> 14:43.110
[Student Name: Lu Xixiao]
[Student Class: Class 7, Grade 12]

15:22.650 --> 15:23.320
We're expecting

15:23.320 --> 15:25.620
a heatwave in the city
over the next few days.

15:25.620 --> 15:26.500
Citizens are reminded

15:26.500 --> 15:28.120
to take fire precautions

15:28.390 --> 15:30.650
and avoid prolonged exposure to the sun.

15:30.910 --> 15:32.190
Experts from the traditional
Chinese medicine hospital

15:32.190 --> 15:33.120
remind everyone

15:33.270 --> 15:34.250
to stay calm

15:34.340 --> 15:36.000
and not let the heat get to you.

15:36.270 --> 15:37.500
With the college entrance exam
approaching,

15:37.500 --> 15:39.800
students should be especially careful.

15:38.390 --> 15:42.370
♪ Should I chase freedom all alone ♪

15:40.100 --> 15:42.960
Watch out for heatstroke
and physical discomfort.

15:43.150 --> 15:44.500
With the extreme heat,

15:43.550 --> 15:46.220
♪ Find an excuse, heed what I've known ♪

15:44.670 --> 15:46.460
if you have elderly or children at home,

15:46.460 --> 15:48.500
remember to open
the windows for fresh air.

15:48.160 --> 15:50.520
♪ Every time I stop and stay ♪

15:48.820 --> 15:49.450
Get down.

15:50.530 --> 15:52.560
♪ For reasons that fade away ♪

15:52.930 --> 15:54.010
Good morning!

15:54.190 --> 15:54.740
Zhou Wan.

15:54.490 --> 15:58.080
♪ Are you out there waiting for me ♪

15:54.810 --> 15:55.700
Wan! Good morning.

15:55.700 --> 15:56.620
Good morning.

15:57.220 --> 15:58.270
You're on the bus too?

15:58.270 --> 15:59.330
I was just on it too.

15:59.880 --> 16:02.430
♪ Through the dark, bravely, steadily ♪

16:00.260 --> 16:01.340
I wanted to find you,

16:01.340 --> 16:03.160
but it was too crowded to get through.

16:03.160 --> 16:04.510
Why aren't you wearing it?

16:03.520 --> 16:07.110
♪ If I could run and land with you ♪

16:04.540 --> 16:05.430
Just this once.

16:05.430 --> 16:06.670
No way. Student ID.

16:08.960 --> 16:10.810
It's you again, huh?

16:09.490 --> 16:12.780
♪ After the long night ♪

16:12.150 --> 16:13.070
Jiang Fan.

16:13.070 --> 16:13.910
-Neither of them is wearing their uniform.
-Grade 12.

16:13.910 --> 16:15.030
-You only go after me?
-Class 7.

16:14.230 --> 16:16.170
♪ I'll find my way, no more lost inside ♪

16:15.030 --> 16:18.150
Your ID number is 201307239, right?

16:17.290 --> 16:20.360
♪ Thinking about ♪

16:18.150 --> 16:19.550
Isn't this targeting me?

16:19.570 --> 16:20.220
No.

16:22.070 --> 16:25.610
♪ Fulfilling the last promise ♪

16:24.460 --> 16:26.230
[No Regrets for Youth
Sail Toward Your Dreams]

16:27.500 --> 16:28.700
I'll trade you for a bun.

16:27.950 --> 16:29.490
♪ We've both held fragility ♪

16:29.980 --> 16:30.820
♪ Talked through our misery ♪

16:31.700 --> 16:34.630
♪ This time
I'm holding tight to your will ♪

16:35.800 --> 16:37.320
♪ Lighting up all the sparks ♪

16:37.860 --> 16:41.690
♪ Hoping it doesn't slip away ♪

16:37.980 --> 16:38.980
Morning, Shanshan.

16:38.980 --> 16:39.680
Morning.

16:43.250 --> 16:44.910
♪ In this boring universe ♪

16:44.930 --> 16:46.470
♪ Drifting day by day ♪

16:46.710 --> 16:50.610
♪ Until the day I choose
to break away for you ♪

16:51.020 --> 16:52.350
♪ And that's enough to do ♪

16:51.860 --> 16:53.430
Run faster!

16:52.200 --> 16:53.670
[College Entrance Exam Countdown]

16:53.440 --> 16:56.290
♪ Falling into your tenderness ♪

16:58.340 --> 17:00.900
♪ Slowly being saved ♪

17:03.160 --> 17:04.750
[Youth Meets the Exam
Now Is the Time to Strive]

17:04.790 --> 17:06.720
[22 Days Until the Exam]

17:25.970 --> 17:26.730
Wan.

17:32.400 --> 17:34.520
♪ We've both held fragility ♪

17:34.650 --> 17:35.890
♪ Talked through our misery ♪

17:35.980 --> 17:39.320
♪ This time
I'm holding tight to your will ♪

17:40.310 --> 17:42.320
♪ Lighting up all the sparks ♪

17:42.340 --> 17:46.360
♪ Hoping it doesn't slip away ♪

17:44.880 --> 17:47.540
[Swimming Pool]

17:47.640 --> 17:49.520
♪ In this boring universe ♪

17:49.520 --> 17:51.140
♪ Drifting day by day ♪

17:51.260 --> 17:55.600
♪ Until the day I choose
to break away for you ♪

17:55.790 --> 17:57.180
♪ And that's enough to do ♪

17:57.900 --> 18:01.230
♪ Falling into your tenderness ♪

18:00.150 --> 18:00.910
Lu Xixiao?

18:02.840 --> 18:05.850
♪ Slowly being saved ♪

18:03.610 --> 18:04.490
Lu Xixiao?

18:22.860 --> 18:23.540
Okay.

18:23.570 --> 18:24.460
I'll get going then.

18:24.460 --> 18:24.990
Go ahead.

18:30.200 --> 18:30.700
Why didn't you go

18:30.700 --> 18:31.900
to class again today?

18:32.690 --> 18:34.420
It's just evening self-study.

18:35.470 --> 18:36.800
No one's waiting for me anyway.

18:36.800 --> 18:38.630
Going there would just cause them trouble.

18:38.630 --> 18:39.240
No.

18:40.050 --> 18:41.450
Got something to repair?

18:46.500 --> 18:47.830
You two know each other?

18:48.850 --> 18:50.580
I never promised you anything.

18:55.150 --> 18:56.410
If I beat you once,

18:56.510 --> 18:58.440
you'll come to one class tomorrow.

18:58.460 --> 18:59.060
Deal?

18:59.830 --> 19:01.230
You're challenging him?

19:01.300 --> 19:02.300
He holds the record

19:02.300 --> 19:03.060
for this entire street.

19:03.060 --> 19:03.980
I can come every day.

19:03.980 --> 19:05.260
And I'm a fast learner.

19:05.340 --> 19:07.200
Sooner or later, he'll lose to me.

19:07.670 --> 19:08.110
She...

19:08.560 --> 19:10.090
She said you'll lose to her.

19:12.830 --> 19:13.460
What?

19:14.910 --> 19:15.770
You don't dare?

19:17.190 --> 19:18.520
She said you don't dare!

19:23.010 --> 19:24.400
Just this once today.

19:25.000 --> 19:26.730
If you lose, stop bothering me.

19:27.540 --> 19:28.800
You're bothering him?

19:30.910 --> 19:32.510
Oh boy. She's bothering you.

19:38.700 --> 19:41.890
Come on! Come on! Come on!

19:50.760 --> 19:51.820
Don't put it there.

19:51.840 --> 19:53.630
She's not coming back for evening study.

19:53.630 --> 19:54.460
Give it to me.

19:56.410 --> 19:57.870
Do you know where she went?

19:58.300 --> 19:59.430
I don't know.

19:59.460 --> 20:00.590
Hasn't she always been like this?

20:00.590 --> 20:01.830
Sometimes when she finds
the classroom too noisy,

20:01.830 --> 20:04.090
she just finds a place to stay by herself.

20:05.430 --> 20:06.210
Come here.

20:06.500 --> 20:08.030
I have something to ask you.

20:10.950 --> 20:12.020
Do you know

20:12.020 --> 20:12.950
how she and Lu Xixiao

20:12.950 --> 20:13.830
met each other?

20:19.020 --> 20:20.350
I haven't finished yet.

20:22.190 --> 20:23.350
You don't know?

20:23.630 --> 20:24.380
You live across from her

20:24.380 --> 20:25.440
and you don't know?

20:25.780 --> 20:26.670
Let me tell you,

20:26.670 --> 20:29.000
she's been acting all mysterious lately.

20:29.060 --> 20:30.300
I think

20:30.590 --> 20:31.250
this guy Lu Xixiao

20:31.250 --> 20:32.450
is kind of dangerous.

20:32.700 --> 20:34.020
I'm a little worried about her.

20:34.020 --> 20:35.020
She never used to get involved

20:35.020 --> 20:36.280
with people like that.

20:40.060 --> 20:40.920
You don't know?

20:41.590 --> 20:42.670
I said I know!

20:44.460 --> 20:45.600
Why are you so fierce?

20:45.600 --> 20:47.400
I won't thank you for your bread!

20:51.910 --> 20:52.660
For you.

20:54.790 --> 20:56.320
We'll play five rounds.

20:56.340 --> 20:58.130
If she wins just one round,

20:58.160 --> 20:59.930
he loses.

21:00.300 --> 21:01.860
Game on.

21:01.880 --> 21:03.050
Round one.

21:03.660 --> 21:05.150
Ready? Go!

21:23.780 --> 21:24.840
[Victory]

21:30.200 --> 21:32.070
Round one. Lu Xixiao wins.

21:32.460 --> 21:34.100
Round two.

21:34.290 --> 21:35.810
Ready? Go!

21:42.930 --> 21:44.580
Round two. Lu Xixiao wins.

21:44.780 --> 21:46.250
Round three.

22:12.290 --> 22:14.990
Round three. Lu Xixiao wins.

22:16.440 --> 22:17.990
Round four.

22:29.600 --> 22:31.620
Four laughs means four wins.

22:31.720 --> 22:32.930
One last round left.

22:32.950 --> 22:34.350
Round five.

22:34.350 --> 22:35.850
It's the last round.

22:36.990 --> 22:37.630
I know.

23:11.220 --> 23:12.280
Don't go easy on me.

23:14.110 --> 23:14.920
Because...

23:20.630 --> 23:21.350
Yes!

23:24.020 --> 23:24.950
I told you.

23:24.980 --> 23:26.310
I'm a very fast learner.

23:30.000 --> 23:31.000
See you tomorrow.

23:36.260 --> 23:36.980
She's amazing.

23:36.980 --> 23:37.590
She swapped the lightest parts

23:37.590 --> 23:38.850
based on the track map.

23:39.260 --> 23:40.990
You didn't let her win, did you?

23:43.780 --> 23:44.950
She volunteered to help you study.

23:44.950 --> 23:46.410
Do you think she likes you?

23:48.110 --> 23:49.110
If only her mind

23:49.110 --> 23:50.110
were that simple.

23:51.220 --> 23:52.550
Are you going tomorrow?

23:54.020 --> 23:55.300
I think you should go.

23:55.370 --> 23:55.950
Hanging around here all day

23:55.950 --> 23:56.780
is so boring.

23:56.980 --> 23:58.380
Go find her. It'll be fun.

24:00.320 --> 24:01.050
I'm leaving.

24:01.430 --> 24:02.890
Remember to lock the door.

24:11.190 --> 24:12.590
Come down for breakfast.

24:14.700 --> 24:16.300
I can't. I'm going to be late.

24:16.300 --> 24:18.360
Then take some fruit to eat at school.

24:19.700 --> 24:22.020
What about you?
Did you take your meds today?

24:22.020 --> 24:23.550
Not yet. I'll take it later.

24:24.390 --> 24:26.370
No, I have to watch you take it,

24:26.400 --> 24:27.800
or you'll forget again.

24:28.540 --> 24:29.300
Um...

24:30.180 --> 24:30.870
Wan,

24:32.190 --> 24:33.190
have you been under

24:33.190 --> 24:34.590
a lot of pressure lately?

24:35.780 --> 24:37.210
I'm fine.

24:37.500 --> 24:38.830
Why do you ask?

24:40.700 --> 24:41.830
That photo.

24:43.020 --> 24:44.950
Why are you thinking about Guo Yan?

24:48.020 --> 24:49.190
I told you

24:49.190 --> 24:50.910
not to clean my room.

24:51.950 --> 24:53.300
If something's on your mind,

24:53.300 --> 24:54.390
tell me.

24:54.390 --> 24:56.050
Don't keep it all to yourself.

24:58.950 --> 25:00.740
I've just been dreaming about her lately.

25:00.740 --> 25:01.870
It's a bit annoying.

25:02.790 --> 25:03.920
Why dream about her?

25:04.060 --> 25:04.950
Without her, we still

25:04.950 --> 25:06.350
live our lives just fine.

25:07.300 --> 25:08.260
The people who left

25:08.260 --> 25:09.830
have been gone.

25:10.180 --> 25:10.880
Remember,

25:11.350 --> 25:12.780
the most important thing right now

25:12.780 --> 25:13.630
is the exam.

25:14.060 --> 25:15.460
You have to move forward.

25:16.460 --> 25:18.410
Don't let anything stop you.

25:18.780 --> 25:19.910
If you don't listen,

25:20.460 --> 25:21.190
don't blame me

25:21.190 --> 25:22.540
for getting mad at you.

25:23.350 --> 25:25.360
Don't be mad.

25:25.700 --> 25:26.780
I'll listen.

25:26.780 --> 25:28.540
You'll listen? Then have a bun.

25:29.110 --> 25:30.190
Take your medicine first.

25:30.190 --> 25:30.740
I will.

25:31.430 --> 25:32.300
I have to watch you finish it

25:32.300 --> 25:33.360
before I can leave.

25:35.150 --> 25:35.950
I'm taking it.

25:41.010 --> 25:41.740
I'm leaving.

25:44.270 --> 25:45.500
Don't choke.

26:24.810 --> 26:25.570
I'm here.

26:29.590 --> 26:31.360
You're on time this time.

26:37.500 --> 26:38.830
You ran all the way here?

26:41.190 --> 26:42.720
Thought I wouldn't be here?

26:43.260 --> 26:44.720
Whether you show up or not,

26:44.830 --> 26:46.360
I'll wait here until you do.

26:50.260 --> 26:51.460
Seems like you really

26:54.830 --> 26:56.240
want to make this money.

26:56.980 --> 26:58.510
It's not just for the money.

26:58.830 --> 27:00.360
I'm very interested in you.

27:00.460 --> 27:02.320
What, I can't be friends with you?

27:11.490 --> 27:12.290
Just kidding.

27:15.170 --> 27:15.900
Let's begin.

27:30.810 --> 27:32.810
But it's true that I'll wait for you.

27:47.550 --> 27:48.500
I prepared this for you.

27:48.500 --> 27:50.500
500 phrases for speaking practice.

27:50.530 --> 27:51.630
These are all high-scoring phrases.

27:51.630 --> 27:53.090
You need to memorize them.

28:32.940 --> 28:34.270
What are you looking at?

28:35.670 --> 28:37.330
Why are you fidgeting so much?

28:40.060 --> 28:41.120
Does it bother you?

28:41.750 --> 28:42.380
No.

28:43.910 --> 28:45.350
People who are good at spinning pens

28:45.350 --> 28:46.810
usually have fast brains.

28:47.630 --> 28:49.160
But obviously, you're not.

28:59.460 --> 29:00.060
Finished.

29:00.630 --> 29:01.460
Stop it.

29:02.630 --> 29:03.630
It's so annoying.

29:07.180 --> 29:09.000
[English Test]

29:31.510 --> 29:35.460
[English Test]

29:38.220 --> 29:38.670
I feel like I don't

29:38.670 --> 29:39.830
really need you.

29:49.700 --> 29:51.030
Your listening is okay.

29:51.500 --> 29:52.830
Cloze and reading are not good.

29:52.830 --> 29:54.060
Your foundation is too weak.

29:54.060 --> 29:56.190
You still need to keep taking classes.

29:59.790 --> 30:01.850
Why do you suddenly want to go abroad?

30:03.430 --> 30:04.390
Would you be better prepared

30:04.390 --> 30:05.740
if you had more time?

30:07.460 --> 30:08.540
No reason.

30:09.300 --> 30:10.590
I just don't want
to be controlled by my family.

30:10.590 --> 30:11.390
That's all.

30:16.060 --> 30:16.860
I'll help you.

30:25.580 --> 30:26.630
Just passing is enough.

30:26.630 --> 30:27.500
Suit yourself.

30:33.460 --> 30:34.260
So does that mean

30:34.260 --> 30:35.860
you'll keep coming to class?

30:38.300 --> 30:38.900
I guess.

30:39.510 --> 30:40.900
You teach decently.

30:41.430 --> 30:42.060
I don't want

30:42.060 --> 30:43.320
to waste any more time.

30:44.910 --> 30:46.570
Let's stick with this for now.

30:49.980 --> 30:51.510
You look pretty decent too.

30:54.260 --> 30:56.460
I said you teach decently.

30:56.460 --> 30:58.320
Then let's plan on tutoring until

30:58.390 --> 31:00.050
the parent-teacher meeting.

31:03.960 --> 31:04.760
Will you come?

31:10.180 --> 31:11.830
♪ If you had ever seen the fireflies ♪

31:13.650 --> 31:14.970
♪ Inside my eyes ♪

31:14.500 --> 31:16.030
Pleasure working with you.

31:18.230 --> 31:19.830
♪ I think you would understand ♪

31:21.540 --> 31:23.660
♪ Why I embrace the dark ♪

31:26.300 --> 31:28.250
♪ People always want to reach out ♪

31:29.320 --> 31:31.980
♪ But are afraid
to pull their hands back ♪

31:33.140 --> 31:35.700
♪ I choose to open my arms wide ♪

31:36.650 --> 31:38.470
♪ And enjoy the weightlessness ♪

31:42.260 --> 31:43.870
♪ If I could, I want to become ♪

31:45.910 --> 31:47.130
♪ An astronomer ♪

31:50.090 --> 31:51.780
♪ Lost in your night sky ♪

31:53.460 --> 31:56.010
♪ Then fall and fall and fall ♪

31:57.340 --> 31:59.510
[Without Passion, There Is No Hope]

31:58.140 --> 31:59.880
♪ Maybe it's your gravity ♪

31:59.020 --> 32:00.110
Don't just act like you're studying

31:59.600 --> 32:02.050
[Give It Your All Today
Win Your Future Tomorrow]

32:00.110 --> 32:01.420
when the teacher's watching.

32:01.380 --> 32:03.600
♪ That held me back from losing control ♪

32:01.540 --> 32:02.870
You're not studying for the teacher,

32:02.870 --> 32:04.030
but for yourselves.

32:04.220 --> 32:04.910
Got it?

32:05.140 --> 32:07.570
♪ When you passed by me by accident ♪

32:06.610 --> 32:08.750
[Ride Your Dreams
Conquer the Peak of the Exam]

32:08.180 --> 32:08.990
Lu Xixiao.

32:09.060 --> 32:10.540
Who's coming to
the parent-teacher meeting
from your family?

32:09.100 --> 32:12.880
♪ I finally learned to fall ♪

32:11.940 --> 32:13.940
Neither of them will probably come.

32:14.260 --> 32:15.140
That won't do.

32:16.010 --> 32:17.280
♪ Countless, unforgettable ♪

32:18.160 --> 32:19.440
♪ No time left, so I ♪

32:19.430 --> 32:20.600
[Ride Your Dreams
Conquer the Peak of the Exam]

32:19.870 --> 32:21.590
Wan! Zhou Wan!

32:20.420 --> 32:22.160
♪ Can only fall toward you ♪

32:21.670 --> 32:23.380
Hurry up, my stomach hurts!

32:24.400 --> 32:26.740
♪ Too dazzling, too lonely, it's alright ♪

32:26.020 --> 32:28.090
Hey, get a parent here, hear me?

32:26.870 --> 32:30.370
♪ I believe in this encounter ♪

32:29.580 --> 32:30.910
Half the cabinet fixed.

32:32.630 --> 32:34.810
♪ Landing in the ruins of the galaxy ♪

32:34.820 --> 32:38.500
♪ Exchanging our comets ♪

32:40.290 --> 32:41.620
♪ Suddenly I am certain ♪

32:41.650 --> 32:44.330
♪ This mud all over me ♪

32:45.240 --> 32:48.190
♪ Is the proof of love ♪

33:09.830 --> 33:11.110
I made this for you.

33:11.140 --> 33:12.200
Mistake notebook.

33:19.300 --> 33:19.900
Thanks.

33:35.980 --> 33:37.350
I want a sausage, please!

33:37.350 --> 33:39.300
I want a sausage, please!

33:39.300 --> 33:40.360
A sausage, please!

33:40.540 --> 33:41.400
Check, please!

33:42.260 --> 33:43.260
See you tomorrow.

33:56.630 --> 33:57.180
No idea.

34:02.910 --> 34:03.970
You can just sleep.

34:04.020 --> 34:05.510
You're really funny,

34:06.020 --> 34:07.540
You're awesome. Let's go.

34:13.560 --> 34:15.570
Mengmeng, class is over.

34:16.570 --> 34:18.219
[Name: Lu Xixiao]
[Class: Class 7, Grade 12]

34:19.429 --> 34:19.989
[Name: Lu Xixiao]
[Class: Class 7, Grade 12]

34:28.870 --> 34:29.580
Class is over!

34:29.580 --> 34:30.270
Thank you.

34:54.750 --> 34:55.710
Don't touch if you're not buying.

34:55.710 --> 34:56.710
You might kill it.

34:57.000 --> 35:00.550
[Fish Blessing Aquarium Shop]

34:57.500 --> 34:59.540
I didn't touch it.
It's almost dead anyway.

34:59.540 --> 35:00.190
Is it dead?

35:00.980 --> 35:01.650
Three days left.

35:01.650 --> 35:02.980
Buy it now if you want it.

35:05.460 --> 35:06.100
Weren't they kept

35:06.100 --> 35:07.620
in a big fish tank before?

35:08.180 --> 35:08.620
Why are they put

35:08.620 --> 35:10.170
in separate bags now?

35:10.310 --> 35:11.240
Isolating them?

35:11.790 --> 35:13.660
Maybe they sell better this way.

35:14.910 --> 35:16.510
Everything has its own fate.

35:20.970 --> 35:22.970
The teacher asked me again recently

35:23.150 --> 35:25.610
if you still take
tutoring classes outside.

35:26.980 --> 35:27.750
No.

35:29.070 --> 35:30.200
I found another job.

35:31.500 --> 35:32.430
What kind of job?

35:32.830 --> 35:33.870
Tutoring someone again?

35:33.610 --> 35:36.030
[Fish Blessing Aquarium Shop]

35:40.430 --> 35:42.770
[Fish Blessing Aquarium Shop]

35:41.310 --> 35:42.110
Tutoring him.

35:43.790 --> 35:44.390
The game already started.

35:44.390 --> 35:45.850
-Where did you go?
-Hello.

35:47.800 --> 35:49.490
How about you guys
play another five rounds?

35:49.490 --> 35:50.420
See you tonight.

35:55.630 --> 35:56.760
Did he threaten you?

35:56.770 --> 36:00.020
[Clearance Sale
3 Days Left]

35:58.750 --> 35:59.880
He wouldn't do that.

36:00.060 --> 36:01.520
He's actually quite nice.

36:01.630 --> 36:03.160
And I approached him first.

36:56.270 --> 36:57.230
You scared me.

36:59.620 --> 37:01.180
I was held up on the way.

37:04.580 --> 37:05.830
As for the missed lesson time,

37:05.830 --> 37:07.230
I'll make up for it later.

37:07.230 --> 37:08.540
Or I can give you a refund.

37:08.540 --> 37:09.910
It's my responsibility.

37:09.910 --> 37:11.580
It's fine. No big deal.

37:12.580 --> 37:14.180
But it is my responsibility.

37:16.230 --> 37:17.560
Where did you leave off?

37:24.230 --> 37:25.660
What's in your bag?

37:27.140 --> 37:28.140
Why is it leaking?

37:29.460 --> 37:30.310
Leaking?

37:36.160 --> 37:36.990
R-Right here.

37:38.620 --> 37:39.530
I'm sorry.

37:45.020 --> 37:46.350
Didn't he give you a box?

37:46.950 --> 37:48.230
They were out of boxes.

37:48.260 --> 37:49.390
Only bags were left.

37:50.230 --> 37:50.910
When I went last time,

37:50.910 --> 37:52.110
they still had boxes.

37:53.270 --> 37:54.530
You've been there too?

37:55.620 --> 37:56.540
Every time I pass by,

37:56.540 --> 37:57.470
I feel terrible.

37:58.950 --> 37:59.790
Yeah.

38:00.950 --> 38:02.750
Things can't go on like this.

38:11.710 --> 38:12.830
So what's the plan?

38:13.540 --> 38:15.400
I just bought them all on impulse.

38:15.460 --> 38:17.260
I haven't figured out a plan yet.

38:17.790 --> 38:19.790
I'm afraid they'll suffocate soon.

38:21.660 --> 38:23.120
I actually do have an idea.

38:24.790 --> 38:26.520
I just don't know if you'd dare.

38:37.580 --> 38:40.960
I will never forget this in my life.

38:41.060 --> 38:44.350
Thank you for the tenderness you gave me.

39:12.310 --> 39:13.600
This lab is broken

39:13.710 --> 39:15.770
and hasn't been reported for repair.

39:17.910 --> 39:18.900
It seems you know our school's

39:18.900 --> 39:20.120
chemistry lab

39:20.540 --> 39:21.400
inside and out.

39:26.060 --> 39:28.120
You clearly never did cleaning duty.

39:28.870 --> 39:31.200
You've clearly done plenty of bad things.

39:37.540 --> 39:38.270
Who's there?

39:44.350 --> 39:45.620
Why is the door open?

39:51.980 --> 39:52.710
Is it broken?

40:20.180 --> 40:20.790
Who's there?

40:20.790 --> 40:21.310
Who's there?

40:21.310 --> 40:21.710
-Run!
-Who?

40:21.710 --> 40:22.240
Let's go.

40:22.790 --> 40:24.050
Who's there? I saw you!

40:27.790 --> 40:28.840
Stop right there!

40:29.540 --> 40:31.140
Stop right there! Don't run!

40:32.660 --> 40:34.790
Little brats, where did you run off to?

40:35.390 --> 40:35.830
Come here.

40:35.830 --> 40:37.060
What are you doing?

40:38.620 --> 40:39.930
It's a dead end ahead.

40:40.460 --> 40:41.180
Stop!

40:41.980 --> 40:42.460
Here.

40:43.140 --> 40:43.670
Zhou Wan.

40:46.140 --> 40:46.540
Take this.

40:46.540 --> 40:47.580
No, no, no.

40:48.820 --> 40:49.470
Zhou Wan.

40:57.500 --> 40:58.560
Give me the beaker.

41:08.540 --> 41:09.200
Zhou Wan.

41:12.660 --> 41:13.660
Get down quickly.

41:14.680 --> 41:15.310
I can't.

41:15.310 --> 41:16.020
-Get down.
-I can't.

41:16.020 --> 41:18.080
It's too high. I'm afraid of heights.

41:18.270 --> 41:20.070
Don't be afraid. I'll catch you.

41:22.620 --> 41:23.220
Come down.

41:26.870 --> 41:27.870
Where did they go?

41:32.180 --> 41:33.110
Don't be afraid.

41:33.240 --> 41:34.150
I'm here.

41:35.020 --> 41:35.790
Don't run!

41:37.350 --> 41:38.790
I saw you!

41:50.350 --> 41:52.650
♪ A muted gray ♪

41:53.610 --> 41:56.670
♪ Everything looks this way ♪

41:55.910 --> 41:56.890
It's okay.

41:57.320 --> 41:58.610
Come down. Don't worry.

41:57.890 --> 42:01.020
♪ Another abandoned place ♪

41:58.710 --> 41:59.770
Just one step away.

42:02.030 --> 42:03.670
♪ Just forget the pain ♪

42:07.660 --> 42:08.560
Got you.

42:08.040 --> 42:12.000
♪ The fragments of our memories ♪

42:12.270 --> 42:14.000
♪ Stolen, frozen ♪

42:12.310 --> 42:13.330
Where'd they go?

42:13.950 --> 42:16.330
Where do you think you're going?

42:14.100 --> 42:15.440
♪ In this river ♪

42:15.570 --> 42:17.490
♪ Lost inside a song ♪

42:17.430 --> 42:18.320
Where'd they go?

42:18.240 --> 42:21.680
♪ Far from where I belong ♪

42:22.350 --> 42:23.280
Where'd they go?

42:24.540 --> 42:26.070
Don't let me catch you!

42:25.190 --> 42:29.130
♪ In this cold, bottomless hole ♪

42:29.420 --> 42:31.530
♪ Something still remains ♪

42:31.690 --> 42:33.990
♪ Hiding beneath the scars ♪

42:34.190 --> 42:37.590
♪ I thought I'd shaken off your shadow ♪

42:37.690 --> 42:39.670
♪ But it lingers on ♪

42:41.540 --> 42:42.930
♪ Quiet as rain ♪

42:45.790 --> 42:47.930
♪ Deep as sea ♪

42:47.320 --> 42:50.350
[2026]

42:50.230 --> 42:53.820
♪ It stirs and stirs and stirs ♪

42:53.990 --> 42:56.940
♪ Forcing me to remember ♪

42:58.850 --> 43:00.760
♪ Flickering like stars ♪

43:03.260 --> 43:05.480
♪ Swaying like a flame ♪

43:07.660 --> 43:11.350
♪ Hanging like a curse in midair ♪

43:11.510 --> 43:15.520
♪ Burning like a wound ♪

43:21.130 --> 43:23.510
♪ Quiet as rain ♪

43:25.480 --> 43:27.690
♪ Deep as sea ♪

43:30.420 --> 43:32.910
♪ It stirs and stirs and stirs ♪

43:34.020 --> 43:36.340
♪ Forcing me to remember ♪

43:38.460 --> 43:40.940
♪ Flickering like stars ♪

43:43.130 --> 43:46.300
♪ Swaying like a flame ♪

43:46.500 --> 43:49.110
♪ Hanging like a curse in midair ♪
